+
+## Coupled run status ownership
+
+The `coupled-status` command reads the native `iterations.json` manifest and each finalized or pending `state/tui-work.json` ledger. It reports durable task and wire request counts, including failed and in-flight requests, and represents unknown interrupted pending usage as `null`. The command is read-only and does not add persistent state; recorded completion remains distinct from independent verification.
